   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att initiera ett samarbete mellan svenska importverksamheten &quot;Sound of Green&quot;, svenska &quot;Sustainable Fashion Academy&quot; och indonesiska &quot;Yayasan Pembangunan Berkelanjutan&quot; f&#xF6;r att ansluta milj&#xF6;v&#xE4;nliga batikproducenter med den svenska marknaden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intention of initiating a partnership between Swedish import business &quot;Sound of Green&quot;, Swedish &quot;Sustainable Fashion Academy&quot; and Indonesian &quot;Yayasan Pembangunan Berkelanjutan is to connect the eco-friendly batik producers with the Swedish market.</narrative>
